'''First-Love Myrcia''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[Valentine Gals (Gacha Event)|Valentine Gals]] Event. She is an anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Myrcia (Uber Rare Cat)|Myrcia]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 588
|rarity = UR
|name1 = First-Love Myrcia
|name2 = First-Love Myrcia, type ξ
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''First-Love Myrcia, type ξ''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Similarly to [[Myrcia (Uber Rare Cat)|Myrcia]], her set of abilities is rather inconvenient. Multi-hit gets in the way of her ability to create [[Wave Attack|waves]], as the two hits are in quick succession, so the first prevents the second from landing if the enemy in question gets knocked back. Waves, then, get in the way of her dodge ability by clearing the weak peons that could keep the ability triggered.

Despite all this, she can still be used as a general unit in [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] or [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] heavy stages, where she can deliver decent base damage and wave damage, while protecting other units at the same time.

Her inconsistent dodge ability, however, makes this unit not recommended to be relied upon on her own, especially in absence of weaker Floating or Red enemies to keep her dodge state active.

{{Job|Classification = Waver & Midranger}}

